This is basically my viewpoint.  Is there a way for me to have zero risk of 
getting burned?  Sure -- turn off the lights and give up running a net.site.

Since I don't want to do that, I do the next best thing.  There is simply 
no way I could ever go into a courtroom and claim I didn't know that there 
was organized copyright infringement going on in abpe or a few other groups.
That I have nuked others besides abpe which also have a high theft ratio
is a good indicator of my actual intentions here.

I could claim I didn't <care> that this was taking place, but that would be
a poor thing to say to a judge and/or jury.  That I <do> care, and try to 
be proactive about this, is likely to play <well> in a courtroom if I ever 
find myself defending against this kind of event.  Since its the only
reasonable stance I believe I can take and still remain connected its
the one I have chosen.

